id: QUAL-055
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Catch-log-ignore anti-pattern
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .java .kt .cs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: catch\s*\([^)]*\)\s*\{\s*(console\.(log|error)|logger\.(error|warn|info)|log\.(error|warn|info)|System\.out\.print|e\.printStackTrace)
    message: "Catch-log-ignore — logging then continuing silently hides the failure from callers"
fix: Rethrow the error (with context), return an error result, or handle it properly. Don't just log and continue.
